OL,3,GNEWSAHormuz swim highlights            
OL,4,Aenvironmental cost of war              
OL,6,FHe is calling for an end to the        
OL,7,Ffighting, the reopening of the Strait  
OL,8,Fof Hormuz and action to address        
OL,9,Fenvironmental damage caused by the     
OL,10,Fconflict.                              
